n: AUTOSAR Dio on HPM5E31 ===
Port_Init done; Dio channels=16 groups=3
SELFTEST: LED write=1 readback=1
type: dio / dled od 0 0xFF / derr / dver
dio
Dio: moduleID=120 channels=16 groups=3 (Dio 无 Init，引脚由 Port_Init 配)
ch0=PA02 LED ch1=PA03 BTN ch2=PC11 ch3=PA27 ch4..11=CAN LEDs ch12=PC12 ch13=PA28 ch14=PC10 ch15=PA26
commands: dio | dled <on|off|flip> | dbtn | dscan | dleds <hex> | dport <0..5> | dgroup | dmasked <lvl> <mask> | derr | dver

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dled on
LED: write=1 readback=1

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dled flip
LED: write=0 readback=0

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dbtn
BTN: PA03=0 (pressed=high) events=0

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dleds A5
LEDS: pattern=0xA5

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dport 5
PORT5: DI=0x073AFA00 DO=0x04380000

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dgroup
GROUP Usr  (GPIOA[3:2]) = 0x0 (bit0=LED bit1=BTN)
GROUP CanLeds(GPIOF[23:16]) = 0x3A

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dmasked 0 0xFF
MASKED: GPIOF DO=0x04380000 (level=0x0 mask=0xFF)

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dscan
SCAN: 8 颗 CAN 灯走 1
SCAN: done

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ derr
DET: before=0 after=6 delta=6

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ dver
Dio_GetVersionInfo: vendor=0xFFFF module=120 sw=1.0.0

letter:/$ 
letter:/$ 